							9785.573
						],
						"pointId": 11326
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751940101,
					"content": "Hey, hey, hey! This stuff's for selling. If you're not buying, you're not touchi— Huh... Hey, you! Yeah, you with the blonde hair — hold on a sec, don't rush off. Let me get a better look at you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940102,
					"content": "Hmm, just as I thought. That hair, glowing like the sun, and those eyes, as deep as the Night Kingdom... I can tell — no, I'm sure — that you're going to become someone incredible one day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940103,
					"content": "Here, I've got a set of wondrous jade ornaments, each containing a different melody. Perfect for a real hero like you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940104,
					"content": "Mind you, these are nothing short of priceless treasures. If anyone else wanted to buy them, I'd be asking for at least 10 million Mora. But I see you're meant to have them, so you can have them at just one-tenth of the price. What do you say?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940105,
					"content": "Whoa, one-tenth!? That's a steal! But wait, isn't that still at least... a million Mora? That's a bit much, don't you think?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940106,
					"content": "Yeah, well... this is basically cost price. Small-time sellers like me don't make a ton of profit, you know?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940107,
						751940108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940107,
					"content": "You really shouldn't be making money like that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751940109,
					"content": "Ah, so you heard all that, huh? Haha, guess I've got a habit of talking to myself...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940110,
					"content": "*sigh* Fine, since you caught me, I'll be real with you. I found this jade ornament by accident. It's not worth anywhere near that price.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940111,
					"content": "But well, as you heard, we're kinda strapped for cash — so much so that we can't even pay anyone to collect the buoy data.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940112,
					"content": "Well, then just forget the buoy collection! Better than ripping people off, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940113,
					"content": "That won't do... Other organizations can just stop operating if they lack the funds, but our volunteer work also includes volcano observation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940114,
					"content": "We planted those buoys to measure volcanic activity by collecting data on water temperature and the like.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940115,
					"content": "With the volcano becoming more active, we need to recover those buoys fast, or there could be serious consequences.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940116,
					"content": "Injured as I am, I can't break the buoys, let alone retrieve the data from them...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940117,
					"content": "#What do you think, {NICKNAME}? Why don't we help her out? This volcano stuff affects everyone, so we can't just ignore it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940118,
					"content": "R—Really? If you're willing to help, these jade ornaments are all yours, for free! Consider it your reward. Sounds good?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940119,
						751940120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940119,
					"content": "Didn't you mention a million Mora...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751940121,
					"content": "Don't worry. We haven't got much, but we certainly have more to give you than just these jade ornaments.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940122,
					"content": "Hehe, they're enough for us! After all, we're doing this for the safety of everyone near the volcano! So don't worry, we've got this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940123,
						751940124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940123,
					"content": "Well, let's begin, then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 751940124,
					"content": "I'll need a moment to prepare.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751940125,
					"content": "I'm good to go anytime.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Kulemana"
				},
				{
					"id": 751940120,
					"content": "Oh, so this is all I get for a reward, huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751940108,
					"content": "Weren't you the one who said that a helper's worth a million Mora?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751940109
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7519404,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7519404
			],
